@model InovaGed.Web.Models.Labels.LabelPrintProfileInput
@{ Layout=null; }
<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><title>Teste de calibração · @Model.ProfileName</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/labels-print.css" asp-append-version="true"/></head><body class="label-calibration-test-body"><div class="label-sheet-toolbar no-print"><strong>@Model.ProfileName</strong><button onclick="window.print()">Imprimir teste</button><a href="/Labels/Calibration">Voltar</a><p>Imprima esta página em escala 100%, sem ajuste automático do navegador. Depois ajuste o deslocamento X/Y e a escala do perfil.</p></div><main class="label-calibration-test-page" style="--label-offset-x-mm:@Model.OffsetXMm;--label-offset-y-mm:@Model.OffsetYMm;--label-scale:@(Model.ScalePercent/100m);--label-margin-top-mm:@Model.MarginTopMm;--label-margin-left-mm:@Model.MarginLeftMm"><div class="calibration-ruler calibration-ruler-x"><span>0</span><span>50 mm</span><span>100 mm</span><span>150 mm</span><span>200 mm</span></div><div class="calibration-ruler calibration-ruler-y"><span>0</span><span>50</span><span>100</span><span>150</span><span>200</span><span>250 mm</span></div><i class="calibration-corner tl"></i><i class="calibration-corner tr"></i><i class="calibration-corner bl"></i><i class="calibration-corner br"></i><section class="calibration-label-box"><strong>ETIQUETA DE TESTE</strong><p>Meça esta caixa após imprimir. As linhas devem permanecer nítidas e paralelas.</p><small>100 × 60 mm · escala @Model.ScalePercent%</small></section></main></body></html>
